 the drugs are coming  across so they need to divert those  resources those funds to the southern  border where they're needed but it's not  it's more than just money it's more than  just funding they need to enact those  policies that were effective you know  prior to 2021 that was working and  that's what they need to do right now is  actually focus on those policies you  know as far as enacting those policies  what's working and provide that support  to border patrol because they need it  right now  lieutenant  chris oliveiras i want to commend you  after the nearly two weeks i spent with  you and lieutenant cassarez lupe and  everybody down there despite these  surging numbers you've gone out every  single day before the sun comes up and  gone after them and i know the morale is  perhaps suffering but you've stayed  strong well done  sir thank you  subscribe to the fox news youtube  channel to catch our nightly opens  stories that are changing the world and  changing your life from tucker carlson  tonight
 

